<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Luminex AI | Türkiye'nin En Gelişmiş Discord Botu</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;
            --secondary: #ec4899;
            --success: #10b981;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --dark: #0f172a;
            --dark-xl: #1e293b;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark) 0%, #1a1a2e 100%);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
        }

        .hero-content {
            text-align: center;
            z-index: 10;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
        }

        .hero-logo {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, var(--primary) 50%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero .tagline {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .hero-stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero-stat {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .hero-stat i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .hero-stat .value {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .hero-stat .label {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .features {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            background: var(--dark-xl);
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .feature-card:hover::before {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }

        .feature-card i {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Commands Section */
        .commands {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            background: var(--dark);
        }

        .commands-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .command-category {
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .command-category h3 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .command-category h3 i {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .command-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .command-list li {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .command-list li:hover {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
        }

        .command-list .cmd-name {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: var(--primary);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .command-list .cmd-desc {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* AI Section */
        .ai-section {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-xl) 0%, #1e1e30 100%);
        }

        .ai-features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .ai-feature {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .ai-feature i {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--success), var(--primary));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        /* CTA Section */
        .cta {
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--dark-xl);
        }

        .cta h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .cta p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.5);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--dark);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        footer p {
            color: #64748b;
        }

        footer a {
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Dashboard Button */
        .dashboard-btn {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 2rem;
            right: 2rem;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .dashboard-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .hero-stats {
                gap: 1rem;
            }
            
            .hero-stat {
                padding: 1rem;
            }
            
            .hero-stat .value {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/1246883721429528606/a_0915be73e2f887158136917e7c90a35c.gif?size=512" alt="Luminex AI" class="hero-logo">
            <h1>LUMINEX AI</h1>
            <p class="tagline">Türkiye'nin En Gelişmiş Yapay Zeka Discord Botu</p>
            
            <div class="hero-stats">
                <div class="hero-stat">
                    <i class="fas fa-server"></i>
                    <div class="value"><%= stats.guilds %></div>
                    <div class="label">Sunucu</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-stat">
                    <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
                    <div class="value"><%= stats.users %></div>
                    <div class="label">Kullanıcı</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-stat">
                    <i class="fas fa-brain"></i>
                    <div class="value"><%= stats.aiMsgCount %></div>
                    <div class="label">AI Etkileşim</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-stat">
                    <i class="fas fa-terminal"></i>
                    <div class="value"><%= stats.commands %></div>
                    <div class="label">Komut</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/servers" class="btn btn-primary">
                <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i>
                Hemen Kullanmaya Başla
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="features">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2><i class="fas fa-star"></i> Özelliklerimiz</h2>
            <p>Luminex AI ile sunucunuzu yönetmenin tadını çıkarın</p>
        </div>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                <h3>🛡️ Gelişmiş Moderasyon</h3>
                <p>Otomatik küfür ve reklam engeli, ban, kick, timeout, uyarı sistemi ve daha fazlası.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-robot"></i>
                <h3>🤖 Yapay Zeka Sohbet</h3>
                <p>Kendi özgün AI'mız ile akıllı, Türkçe konuşan ve yardımsever bir asistan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-gift"></i>
                <h3>🎉 Çekiliş Sistemi</h3>
                <p>Gelişmiş çekiliş sistemi ile kullanıcılarını ödüllendir.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-ticket-alt"></i>
                <h3>🎫 Ticket Sistemi</h3>
                <p>Profesyonel destek ticket sistemi ile kullanıcılarından gelen talepleri yönet.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                <h3>📈 Seviye Sistemi</h3>
                <p>XP ve seviye atlayarak roller kazan. Liderlik tablosunda zirveye çık.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-users-cog"></i>
                <h3>⚙️ Otomasyon</h3>
                <p>Otorol, hoş geldin mesajları, otomatik log ve daha birçok otomasyon özellikleri.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Commands Section -->
    <section class="commands">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Komutlarım</h2>
            <p>Tüm komutları keşfet ve sunucunu yönet</p>
        </div>

        <div class="commands-grid">
            <!-- Moderation -->
            <div class="command-category">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-gavel"></i> Moderasyon</h3>
                <ul class="command-list">
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/ban</span><span class="cmd-desc">Kullanıcıyı yasakla</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/kick</span><span class="cmd-desc">Kullanıcıyı at</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/timeout</span><span class="cmd-desc">Kullanıcıyı sustur</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/uyar</span><span class="cmd-desc">Kullanıcıyı uyar</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/sil</span><span class="cmd-desc">Mesajları sil</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/nuke</span><span class="cmd-desc">Kanalı temizle</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/küfür-engel</span><span class="cmd-desc">Küfür engelini aç/kapat</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/reklam-engel</span><span class="cmd-desc">Reklam engelini aç/kapat</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Eğlence -->
            <div class="command-category">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-gamepad"></i> Eğlence</h3>
                <ul class="command-list">
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/espri</span><span class="cmd-desc">Rastgele espri yap</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/fıkra</span><span class="cmd-desc">Komik fıkra anlat</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/zar</span><span class="cmd-desc">Zar at</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/yazı-tura</span><span class="cmd-desc">Yazı tura at</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/taş-kağıt-makas</span><span class="cmd-desc">Oyna</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/çekiliş-başlat</span><span class="cmd-desc">Çekiliş düzenle</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/oylama</span><span class="cmd-desc">Oylama oluştur</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/ascii</span><span class="cmd-desc">ASCII sanat oluştur</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Kullanıcı -->
            <div class="command-category">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-user"></i> Kullanıcı</h3>
                <ul class="command-list">
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/profil</span><span class="cmd-desc">Profilini görüntüle</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/avatar</span><span class="cmd-desc">Avatarını büyüt</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/sunucu-bilgi</span><span class="cmd-desc">Sunucu bilgisi</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/seviye</span><span class="cmd-desc">Seviyeni gör</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/sıralama</span><span class="cmd-desc">Liderlik tablosu</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/afk</span><span class="cmd-desc">AFK moduna geç</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/çeviri</span><span class="cmd-desc">Çeviri yap</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Bot -->
            <div class="command-category">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-robot"></i> Bot</h3>
                <ul class="command-list">
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/ping</span><span class="cmd-desc">Bot gecikmesi</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/yardım</span><span class="cmd-desc">Yardım menüsü</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/istatistik</span><span class="cmd-desc">Bot istatistikleri</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cmd-name">/davet</span><span class="cmd-desc">Davet linki al</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AI Section -->
    <section class="ai-section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> Yapay Zeka Özellikleri</h2>
            <p>Kendi özgün AI'mız ile tanışın</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-features">
            <div class="ai-feature">
                <i class="fas fa-comments"></i>
                <h3>Akıllı Sohbet</h3>
                <p>Doğal Türkçe konuşan, sorularınızı yanıtlayan yapay zeka asistanı</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-feature">
                <i class="fas fa-image"></i>
                <h3>Görsel Analiz</h3>
                <p>Resimleri analiz edip açıklama yapabilen vizyon özelliği</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-feature">
                <i class="fas fa-memory"></i>
                <h3>Öğrenen Hafıza</h3>
                <p>Konuşmaları hatırlayan ve kişiselleştirilmiş yanıtlar veren sistem</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-feature">
                <i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i>
                <h3>Güvenli & Kontrolü</h3>
                <p>Temiz ve güvenli yapay zeka deneyimi için gelişmiş filtrasyon</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="cta">
        <h2>Luminex AI'yı Sunucuna Ekle</h2>
        <p>Hemen Discord sunucuna ekle ve farkı hisset!</p>
        <a href="https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1246883721429528606&permissions=8&scope=bot" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">
            <i class="fab fa-discord"></i>
            Discord'a Ekle
        </a>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>© 2024 Luminex AI - Tüm hakları saklıdır</p>
        <p>Geliştirici: <a href="#">necati9880</a> | Kurucu: <a href="#">luminexcode</a></p>
    </footer>

    <!-- Dashboard Button -->
    <a href="/servers" class="dashboard-btn">
        <i class="fas fa-cog"></i>
    </a>
</body>

</html>